# LanceHive Core

**Stack:** Laravel 13 · PHP 8.3+ · PostgreSQL 18 · Sail · Sanctum API · Pest · API **`/api/v1`**

## Commands (always via Sail)

`vendor/bin/sail artisan …` · `vendor/bin/sail artisan test --compact {path}` · `vendor/bin/sail bin pint --dirty --format agent`

## Architecture (one line)

Feature slices under `app/Features/{Name}/` (not versioned) · route files in `routes/features/v1/` · URLs `/api/v1` via `config/api.php` · tests `tests/Feature/{Name}/` + `$this->apiUrl()`.

## Global rules (always on)

| Rule | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `01-ai-token-guard.mdc` | Minimum context, reads, output |
| `02-agent-verification.mdc` | When to run Sail tests, Pint, builds |

## Token guard (summary)

1. **Do not** read all of `docs/` — one doc from the table below.
2. **Do not** re-read `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` if a scoped rule already covers the path.
3. Build tasks → current task block only (`lancehive-build-task`).
4. Auth/errors/tests → `lancehive-guardrails` first.
5. Verification → `02-agent-verification.mdc` (narrow Pest after code changes; never full suite unless asked).

